{"status":"success","data":[{"site":{"siteid":42133,"sitename":"Kulivatnet","sitedescription":"Kulivatnet is a small subarctic lake in northern Norway. The lake is located within the Vågneselva, a northeast-southwest trending glacially sculpted lineament. It is situated within a small but hilly catchment area, with hills up to 120 m high.  Runoff from this catchment and from the small boggy area to the southwest supplies the lake with water.  There is a single outflow at the northeast end of the lake. Vegetation around the lake can be characterized as Betula-woodland. The dominant tree is Betula pubescens, although Pinus sylvestris and Picea abies are found planted on a small hill around the pond.  Shrubs include several species of Salix sp., along with Sorbus aucuparia.  Among the common subshrubs are Vaccinium myrtillis, Vaccinium vitis-idaea.   Chamaepericlymenum suecicum, Juniperus communis and Empetrum nigrum.  Along with numerous species of Poaceae and Cyperaceae, common herbs include Geranium cf sylvaticum.  Campanula cf rotundifolia, Solidago virgaurea, Fragaria vesca and Pedicularis sceptrum-carolinum, with members of the Fabaceae, Apiace and Schrophulariaceae.  Equisetum pratense, Eriophorum angustifolium, Bistorta vivipara and Menyanthes trifoliata grow in wetter areas near and along the shore.","sitenotes":null,"geography":"{\"type\":\"Point\",\"crs\":{\"type\":\"name\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"EPSG:4326\"}},\"coordinates\":[19.28,69.77]}","altitude":75,"collectionunitid":56050,"collectionunit":null,"handle":"KULIVAT","unittype":"Core","datasets":[{"doi":[],"agerange":[],"database":"Neotoma","datasetid":74807,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"R.S.","contactid":7,"firstname":"R. Scott","familyname":"Anderson","contactname":"Anderson, R. Scott"}],"datasettype":"geochronologic","datasetnotes":null,"recdatecreated":"2026-08-18T21:16:54"},{"doi":["10.21233/rce6-h991"],"agerange":[{"units":"Calibrated radiocarbon years BP","ageold":14840,"ageyoung":-50}],"database":"Neotoma","datasetid":74808,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"R.S.","contactid":7,"firstname":"R. Scott","familyname":"Anderson","contactname":"Anderson, R. Scott"}],"datasettype":"pollen","datasetnotes":null,"recdatecreated":"2026-08-18T21:17:00"}]}}],"message":"Retrieved all tables"}